# mm.json

RFC 8259 JSON, read and written without exceptions, without templates of its
own, and -- in the scanner -- without allocation. docs/modules-json.mdy
specifies it.

Three partitions, listed before the primary interface because source order is
declared. :status is the vocabulary the other two share. :scan is a pull
reader over a string view that a fixed-buffer caller can use as it is. :value
is a document model, parse, and write above the scanner, for the host tools.
The module has no use: edge: it needs the standard library and nothing in the
tree.
